		<title>Justice With Judge Mablean</title>
		<desc lang="en">Judge Mablean Ephriam, who presided over &quot;Divorce Court&quot; from 1999-2006 as the first star of the revived version of the show, returns to the courtroom genre with his half-hour series that deals with life and the law. The former Los Angeles-based prosecutor takes on the typical cases that are found on TV court shows. The arbitrator says that her show &quot;will be life because everything we do, it involves the law.&quot;</desc>
