	<programme start="20260721120000 +0000" stop="20260721130000 +0000" channel="US102182.hdhomerun.com">
		<title>Interview With a Killer</title>
		<sub-title>The Golden Boy - Tommy Gilbert, Jr.</sub-title>
		<desc lang="en">In his first ever television interview, killer Thomas Gilbert, Jr. discusses the murder that shook New York's elite. The Princeton-educated Gilbert became a tabloid obsession when he shot his father after his $1,000 allowance was cut off. But in this unique installment of Interview With a Killer, Gilbert appears to be a far cry from his once golden upbringing. Host David Scott explores his long history of mental illness and the privileged pressure cooker that shaped his downfall.</desc>
		<date>20260517</date>
		<category>Series</category>
		<category>Crime</category>
