	<programme start="20260722020000 +0000" stop="20260722030000 +0000" channel="US102182.hdhomerun.com">
		<title>Interview With a Killer</title>
		<sub-title>Toxic Love - Frank Bredt</sub-title>
		<desc lang="en">When flames tore through a Buffalo, New York home in 2018, the investigation revealed a toxic relationship and a hot-tempered arsonist, Frank Bredt, Jr. Now Bredt is talking about his crime from behind bars. In this episode of Interview With a Killer, host David Scott revisits the fire, the evidence, and the unraveling timeline - exposing a jilted lover hidden behind smoke and destruction and giving viewers an unfiltered look into the chilling death of an innocent mother.</desc>
		<date>20260510</date>
		<category>Series</category>
		<category>Crime</category>
		<language>en</language>
		<icon src="https://img.hdhomerun.com/titles/C28342542EN55M2.jpg" width="360" height="270"/>
