	<programme start="20260721110000 +0000" stop="20260721120000 +0000" channel="US111990.hdhomerun.com">
		<title>Interview With a Killer</title>
		<sub-title>Overkill - Nicholas 'Pickles' Camfield</sub-title>
		<desc lang="en">In 2013, the small city of Weatherford, Texas was rocked by the brutal slaying of local son, JD Doss. The murder weapon? A pickaxe. The murderer? His close friend, 24-year-old Nicholas Camfield. In a shocking twist, Camfield not only killed his victim by repeatedly striking him in the head, he also mutilated, scalped, and defiled his body over the course of days. In one of David Scott's most shocking interviews, Camfield gives a glimpse inside his deranged, murderous mind.</desc>
		<date>20260518</date>
		<category>Series</category>
		<category>Crime</category>
		<language>en</language>
		<icon src="https://img.hdhomerun.com/titles/C28342542EN55M2.jpg" width="360" height="270"/>
		<series-id system="cseries">C28342542EN55M2</series-id>
