		<title>The Adventures of Ozzie &amp; Harriet</title>
		<desc lang="en">Long-running sitcom &quot;The Adventures of Ozzie and Harriet,&quot; based on a radio show of the same name, is one of the shows from the period that epitomized the values of the 1950s and early '60s through the all-American nuclear family. The series stars real-life married couple Ozzie and Harriet Nelson as well as their sons, David and Ricky. The focus of the series is the Nelsons' home life as they deal with run-of-the-mill problems that families of the day faced. By the time the show went off the air, it had produced 435 episodes over 14 seasons.</desc>
		<date>19521003</date>
