	<programme start="20260721133000 +0000" stop="20260721140000 +0000" channel="US59212.hdhomerun.com">
		<title>Chasing Down Madison Brown</title>
		<desc lang="en">Madison Brown is used to being on the road, having grown up on a tour bus traveling with her father Mark Miller, lead singer of country group Sawyer Brown. That experience at a young age helped develop in Madison an appreciation for exploring new places, which carries over to this day now that she is an adult and enjoying her post-college life. Inspired by her long-running blog, from which this show gets its name, Brown hits the road to bring viewers behind the scenes of big events and tourist attractions. She also interviews celebrities -- some of whom are family friends -- including country star Toby Keith, former NBA player Karl Malone, former MLB pitcher Greg Maddux and &quot;Brady Bunch&quot; star Christopher Knight, Brown's uncle.</desc>
		<date>20220825</date>
