		<desc lang="en">Upon returning home from active duty, it can be difficult for veterans to transition into civilian life. &quot;Hiring America&quot; tries to make it a little easier by showcasing companies that have jobs available for current and former members of the armed forces. In addition to the career opportunities, the show welcomes career counselors and HR specialists who provide tips to help the military members ease back into the civilian workforce. The show also features organizations that provide services to help facilitate the transition process. Gigi Stone Woods hosts the half-hour show.</desc>
