		<desc lang="en">&quot;Family Feud&quot; has seen some crazy moments over the years, so buckle up as we revisit these fan favorites. This fast-paced clip show delivers the funniest, most viral and most unforgettable highlights from America's favorite game show. From hilariously wrong answers to Steve Harvey's one-of-a kind reactions, &quot;Family Feud Favorites&quot; captures the best moments that fans can't stop talking about.</desc>
